# src/devices/cpu/anotherworld/anotherworld.cpp (main implementation)
# src/devices/cpu/anotherworld/anotherworld.h (structures)
# src/mame/drivers/another_world_vm.cpp (machine driver)
```

---

This reference implementation provides the correct VM semantics that the KN5000 port should be compared against. The code review document you have (`docs/code-review-2026-02-09.md`) does exactly this comparison and identifies 20 major missing/broken items.

